Finds the five topics nearest in meaning to a subject and angle, stated as you would at intake: "Rust, the programming language", "plain words for newcomers". It compares them with the subject, angle and description of every topic taken in, so it finds a topic asked for under another name entirely. It runs the embedder, so call it when find_topics_by_name doesn't settle whether the subject is covered already. A name not yet taken in has no meaning to match; find_topics_by_name finds those. The meaning match runs from 0 to 1.
